DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Bohn Hall Community Meeting! This is your oppo
 rtunity to connect with your Professional Staff\, student staff\, and fel
 low residents as we kick off the semester together. At this meeting\, we’
 ll cover important information about living in Bohn Hall\, including comm
 unity expectations\, resources\, and ways to get involved.\nResidents wil
 l also have the chance to ask questions\, share feedback\, and meet other
 s in the building. Attendance is encouraged to stay up-to-date and make t
 he most out of your living experience on campus.\nWhat to Expect:\n\nReso
 urces and support available to you\nOpportunities to connect with staff a
 nd peers\nA chance to ask questions and share your voice\n\nWe look forwa
 rd to seeing you there!\nThis event is for Bohn Hall Residents \n\nHosted
  by: Bohn Hall\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montcla
 ir.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12600211
