CATEGORIES:Cultural
DESCRIPTION:Interested in adding a valuable credential to your degree? Sto
 p by our Undergraduate Certificate in Spanish for the Professions Pop-Up 
 Info Session & Coffee to learn how the certificate can enhance your commu
 nication skills and career opportunities.\nOpen to undergraduate students
 \, especially those majoring in Justice Studies\, Business\, Accounting\,
  and Health-related fields. Enjoy a cup of coffee\, ask questions\, and l
 earn how the program can fit into your academic plan.\n-----\n08/24 11am-
 1pm | Schmitt Hall 138\n08/25 10am-12pm | Zoom\n09/01 at 12-2pm | Schmitt
  Hall 138\n-----\n¿Te interesa agregar una credencial valiosa a tu carrer
 a? Visita nuestra Sesión Informativa Pop-Up y Café sobre el Certificado d
 e Pregrado en Español para las Profesiones para conocer cómo este certifi
 cado puede fortalecer tus habilidades de comunicación y ampliar tus oport
 unidades profesionales.\nAbierto a estudiantes de pregrado\, especialment
 e de Justicia\, Negocios\, Contabilidad y áreas de la Salud. Disfruta de 
 un café\, haz tus preguntas y descubre cómo este programa puede complemen
 tar tu plan de estudios.----\n\nHosted by: College of Humanities and Soci
 al Sciences (CHSS)\, Center for Latino Heritage & Spanish Language Excell
 ence\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campusl
 abs.com/engage/event/12539780
DTEND:20260824T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T020556Z
DTSTART:20260824T160000Z
LOCATION:CLaSE Office
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:UG Cert in Spanish for the Profession Pop Up Info session & Coffee
