CATEGORIES:Weeks of Welcome
DESCRIPTION:Come hang out with the Center for Academic Success & Tutoring 
 (CAST) & Sprague Library team at our Weeks of Welcome event! It’s a great
  chance to relax\, have some fun\, and connect. You can play a game with 
 our friendly fall academic support crew—Librarians\, Peer Tutors & Peer A
 cademic Coaches\, —and enjoy some tasty snacks. Feel free to kick back wi
 th friends in our usual tutoring spaces or start a board game. Visitors c
 an also create their own personal pin a for the semester. Our staff are e
 ager to join in the fun or share their favorite tips for a successful sem
 ester.\nGot a quick question or want to set up an appointment to kick off
  the semester strong? We’re here to help! Plus\, everyone attending will 
 get first dibs on booking for our Fall 2026 tutoring & peer coaching sess
 ions. Hope to see you there!\n\nHosted by: Center for Academic Success & 
 Tutoring\, Sprague Library\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12545187
DTEND:20260824T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T020556Z
DTSTART:20260824T180000Z
GEO:40.859750;-74.199750
LOCATION:Sprague Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
