BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Arts
CATEGORIES:Small Scale
CATEGORIES:Casual/ Relaxed
CATEGORIES:Weeks of Welcome
CATEGORIES:FYP
DESCRIPTION:What if you could bottle up the very beginning of your Montcla
 ir story?\nMontclair Mixtape is a collaborative Welcome Week zine where e
 very student gets to create a page that captures who they are right now—t
 heir favorite songs\, big goals\, random interests\, and everything they 
 hope to experience during their first year at Montclair.\nThen\, make it 
 yours! Decorate your page with stickers\, doodles\, magazine cutouts\, co
 lors\, lyrics\, photos\, or anything else that feels like you. While crea
 ting\, students can chat\, swap recommendations\, discover shared interes
 ts\, and get to know the people around them.\nThroughout Welcome Week\, p
 ages will be collected and brought together into one giant collaborative 
 “Montclair Mixtape” zine—a snapshot of the students\, dreams\, personalit
 ies\, and playlists that make up YOUR first week on campus.\nWith student
  permission\, the finished zine can be shared digitally through Canva\, c
 reating a time capsule students can revisit long after Welcome Week is ov
 er.\nBecause your first week isn't just the beginning of college—it's the
  first page of your Montclair story. 🎧📖\n\nHosted by: Campus Activities
 \, Office of Student Belonging\, WMSC 90.3 FM\n\nAdditional Information c
 an be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12559163
DTEND:20260824T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T020556Z
DTSTART:20260824T190000Z
LOCATION:University Hall Room 2044
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Montclair Mixtape: Build-a-Zine with WMSC
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12559163
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12559163
X-HOSTS:WMSC 90.3 FM
END:VEVENT
