  receive raffle entries for the GRAND PRIZE\, which is a brand-new iPad! 
 The grand prize winner will be announced during Rec Fest on 9/1. Come for
  a chance to win big!\nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nFree with valid Montclair Sta
 te ID\n\nWhere and When?\n\nMonday and Wednesday\, August 24th and 26th\,
  2026\n2:30pm - 4:30pm\nStudent Recreation Center Lobby/Lounge\n\n \n\nHo
 sted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12520043
