CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Weeks of Welcome
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFinding Your Civic Voice. Your Voice H
 as Power. Come learn wow to use it.\nKick off the semester by discovering
  the power of your voice! As part of Weeks of Welcome\, Civic and Voter E
 ngagement invites you to Finding Your Civic Voice\, an interactive worksh
 op designed to help you connect your passions with meaningful civic actio
 n.\nThrough engaging activities and guided discussion\, you'll explore wh
 at civic voice means\, reflect on the issues that matter most to you\, an
 d identify how your unique experiences and perspectives can make a differ
 ence. Whether you're passionate about education\, the environment\, menta
 l health\, social justice\, or another cause\, this workshop will help yo
 u transform your ideas into action.\nTogether\, we'll explore how everyda
 y actions—such as voting\, volunteering\, advocating\, or engaging in res
 pectful dialogue—can strengthen your community and create lasting impact.
  You'll also learn how to communicate your perspective in a clear and mea
 ningful way while developing an achievable next step to stay involved thr
 oughout your time at Montclair State.\nParticipants will:\n\nExplore what
  civic voice is and why it matters\nIdentify an issue they're passionate 
 about\nDevelop a concise message that reflects their values and experienc
 es\nLeave with a practical action plan to begin making a difference\n\nWh
 ether you're new to civic engagement or already involved\, this workshop 
 is a great opportunity to meet fellow students\, share ideas\, and start 
 the year with purpose. Join us during Weeks of Welcome and discover how y
 our voice can help shape both our campus and our communities.\n\n\n\n\n\n
  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nHosted by: Civic & Voter Engagement\, O
 ffice of Student Belonging\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
 ps://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12539150
DTEND:20260826T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T020556Z
DTSTART:20260826T190000Z
