 \, and fun!\n \nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nReserve your spot on Engage! Space i
 s limited.\n\nWhere and When?\n\nFriday the 28th\, 2026\n6:30pm-8:30pm\nS
 tart Place is Panzer\n\n \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather chang
 es\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, limited vision\, dehydration\, allergic re
