CATEGORIES:CommunityService
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Montclair State faculty\, staff\, and students—it’
 s time to be a hero! Join us for our Blood Drive in proud partnership wit
 h the American Red Cross and help make a life-saving impact. Whether you’
 re a first-time donor or a seasoned pro\, your donation can help replenis
 h critical blood supplies used in emergencies\, surgeries\, and more. It’
 s quick\, easy\, and one of the most meaningful ways to give back to your
  community.\nSo roll up your sleeve\, grab a friend\, and join us in turn
 ing compassion into action—because every drop counts. Snacks\, smiles\, a
 nd gratitude await! \nDonors also get an exclusive American Cross X Hello
  Kitty collectable item\, while supplies last.\nRSVPing on Engage does no
 t mean you are registered to donate. You must click and follow the link b
 elow in order to register as a donor for the drive!\nhttps://www.redcross
 blood.org/give.html/drive-results?zipSponsor=Redhawk\n\nHosted by: Volunt
 eer Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.c
 ampuslabs.com/engage/event/12508604
