BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Social
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable adventure to the Pennsylvania Ren
 aissance Faire\, beginning with an overnight camping experience under the
  stars. Wake up refreshed and ready to journey into a vibrant village fil
 led with knights\, jesters\, artisans\, live performances\, unique shops\
 , and delicious food. Explore the Faire’s extravagant interpretation of t
 he Renaissance era while enjoying exciting entertainment and memorable ex
 periences with fellow adventurers. Space is limited\, so be sure to reser
 ve your spot early.\n \nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegister here or in the Stud
 ent Recreation Center main office or over the phone (973-655-3340).\nCost
  for Students: $30 | Faculty/Staff/Guest: $75\n\nWhere and When?\n\nSepte
 mber 12th-13th\, 2026\n9am on the 12th and 3pm on the 13th \nDeparts from
  Student Recreation Center\n\n \nWhat to Bring: Overnight tooth brush\, p
 ajamas\, clothes\, sunscreen\, money for personal expenses.\n \nPotential
  Hazards: Unpredictable weather changes\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, limit
 ed vision\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous plants\, insect bi
 tes and injury by running\, including sprains\, lacerations\, abrasions a
 nd fractures.\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information c
 an be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12506168
DTEND:20260913T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T020556Z
DTSTART:20260912T130000Z
LOCATION:Meet at the Student Recreation Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
